   Legitimate client connects to the network and requires IP configuration parameters.
   `Client broadcasts DHCP Discover` request looking for a response from a DHCP server.
   `Both servers receive` the `message`.
   ![DNS spoof2](img/spoof2.png)
2. DHCP Servers Respond with Offers
   `Legitimate and Rogue DHCP servers` each `respond with valid IP configuration parameters`.
